  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.2: fix TCP protoc invocation to include protobuf well-known imports path (google/protobuf/* now resolves, including Empty->void scenarios). 1.1.1: add changelog/release notes. 1.1.0: google.protobuf.Empty response now maps to a C# void handler (no auto-reply); dropped the Raphael prefix from all build properties (RaphaelTcp* -> Tcp*) - breaking for consuming csproj. See CHANGELOG.md.",
